  "description": "When your race team is one of the best in the world, you need to back it with the best equipment available. Our Werx bikes are the machines the Haro-adidas team uses to hammer the on the race circuits, and with a Downhill World Championship and a NORBA Short Track title in 2004 you know they’re not just race tested, they’re race proven. The new Seven was inspired by the shorter, less technical downhills and 4x courses that are emerging in today's racing venues. The Werx 7 provides a generous 7\" of travel while still maintaining pedaling efficiency needed for finish line sprints and flat sections.",
